flowchart LR
  Source[Markdown source] --> Split[Lossless frontmatter split]
  Split --> Raw[Raw frontmatter authority]
  Raw --> Flat[Flat compatibility decoder]
  Flat -->|supported scalar| Data[Partial Clojure data view]
  Flat -->|nested / structural YAML| Omit[Omit rather than misrepresent]
  Flat --> Provenance[decoder id + partial status + capabilities]
  Raw --> Future[Future complete YAML decoder]
